  "/floor-games": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Floor games | MimiPip</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fffaf2;color:#263c43;font:17px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1190px;margin:auto;padding:0 clamp(18px,4vw,56px) 70px}nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e7dfd2}nav img{width:120px;vertical-align:middle}a{color:inherit}nav a,.card{text-decoration:none}a:hover .title,nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #166c70;outline-offset:4px}h1,h2,.title{font-family:ui-rounded,'Avenir Next',system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,78px);margin:.18em 0}h2,.title{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,40px);margin:.22em 0}.ey{font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px}.intro{padding:42px 0 30px}.intro p{margin:.4em 0;max-width:570px}.tiles,.detail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(18px,3vw,40px)}.card{display:block;margin-bottom:12px}.room{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:22px}.caption{padding:17px 3px 4px}.chip{background:var(--t);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 12px;display:inline-block;font-weight:650;font-size:13px}.caption p{margin:.3em 0}.size{font-size:14px;color:#53656b}.detail{padding:35px 0;align-items:center}.detail h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,72px)}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#21484a;color:white;border-radius:28px;padding:10px 20px;margin:5px 0;text-decoration:none}.more{max-width:820px;margin:20px auto}details{border-top:1px solid #ddd6c9;padding:18px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}details img{max-width:440px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:15px 0}.home{font-size:14px}@media(max-width:670px){.tiles,.detail{grid-template-columns:1fr}.detail{gap:15px}.intro{padding-top:24px}}</style></head><body><main><nav><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><header class=\"intro\"><span class=\"ey\">MimiPip · Indoor play</span><h1>Floor games</h1><p>A hopscotch trail, a rhythm track, a puzzle for two. Find a spot in your child’s room and discover four ways to play.</p></header><div class=\"tiles\"><a class=\"card\" style=\"--t:#ffe0cf\" href=\"/floor-games/hopscotch-peach-pop/\"><img class=\"room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/room-v4.webp\" alt=\"Peach Pop floor sticker shown installed in a child’s playroom\"><div class=\"caption\"><span class=\"chip\">Hopscotch</span><h2 class=\"title\">Peach Pop</h2><p>Follow the numbers from one to ten, one little hop at a time.</p><span class=\"size\">75 × 260 cm</span></div></a><a class=\"card\" style=\"--t:#d2ede1\" href=\"/floor-games/wiggleway/\"><img class=\"room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/floor-play-images/wiggleway/room-v4.webp\" alt=\"Wiggleway floor sticker shown installed in a child’s playroom\"><div class=\"caption\"><span class=\"chip\">Rhythm &amp; storytelling</span><h2 class=\"title\">Wiggleway</h2><p>Clap on a colour, remember a route, or tell a story as you go.</p><span class=\"size\">114 × 152 cm</span></div></a><a class=\"card\" style=\"--t:#ffe9a9\" href=\"/floor-games/jump-jamboree/\"><img class=\"room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/room-v4.webp\" alt=\"Jump Jamboree floor sticker shown installed in a child’s playroom\"><div class=\"caption\"><span class=\"chip\">Jump &amp; balance</span><h2 class=\"title\">Jump Jamboree</h2><p>Feet together, feet apart. Turn six rows of dots into a clapping tune.</p><span class=\"size\">82 × 214 cm</span></div></a><a class=\"card\" style=\"--t:#dee6fc\" href=\"/floor-games/fork-and-friends/\"><img class=\"room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/floor-play-images/fork-and-friends/room-v4.webp\" alt=\"Fork &amp; Friends floor sticker shown installed in a child’s playroom\"><div class=\"caption\"><span class=\"chip\">Cooperative puzzle</span><h2 class=\"title\">Fork &amp; Friends</h2><p>Start at opposite rings. Can you find a way to swap places?</p><span class=\"size\">114 × 178 cm</span></div></a></div></main></body></html>",
  "/play/hopscotch-peach-pop": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Peach Pop • Play guide | MimiPip</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff9ee;color:#253d53;font:18px/1.5 system-ui}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,74px);line-height:1.04;margin:16px 0}h2{margin-top:34px}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.brand{letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:750}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:18px}.box{background:white;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:12px 0}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#253d53;color:white;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none}a{color:#164e67}figure{margin:0}figcaption{font-size:15px}details{padding:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}nav img{vertical-align:middle}.grid img{border-radius:20px}h1,h2{letter-spacing:-.035em}main{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 3%,#ffebbe 0,transparent 310px)}.btn{margin:6px 0}</style><main><nav style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\" style=\"width:120px\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><h1>Peach Pop</h1><p>Pick one way to play. Learn the rule, then put the phone away.</p><section class=\"box\"><h2>1. Hop to Ten</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Start just below 1. Step onto 1, then place one foot on each square of the next pair. Follow the numbers to 10. Walk back beside the sticker. Try small hops when comfortable.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>2. Secret Stop</h2><b>1 or more</b><p>Choose a number before you start. Travel in order and freeze when you reach it; on a pair, freeze when either number is your choice. Finish at 10. Next round, choose two stops.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>3. Echo Squares</h2><b>2 or more, taking turns</b><p>The leader walks from 1 to 10 and waves on one chosen row. The next child repeats the wave in the same place and adds a clap on another row. Keep building until you want a fresh sequence.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>4. Ten-Tale Trail</h2><b>1 or more</b><p>Choose a character and a place. At each row add a sentence to their adventure. Give the story an ending at 10. On the next trip a new storyteller can choose a new character.</p></section><p>Use a clear, level indoor floor. Start by walking; try jumps only when comfortable. Take turns unless a game calls for two players on separate spots.</p><a class=\"btn\" download href=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/four-ways.png\">Save the four-way instruction image</a><p><a href=\"/floor-games/hopscotch-peach-pop/\">See the game and its size</a></p></main></html>",
  "/play/wiggleway": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Wiggleway • Play guide | MimiPip</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff9ee;color:#253d53;font:18px/1.5 system-ui}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,74px);line-height:1.04;margin:16px 0}h2{margin-top:34px}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.brand{letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:750}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:18px}.box{background:white;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:12px 0}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#253d53;color:white;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none}a{color:#164e67}figure{margin:0}figcaption{font-size:15px}details{padding:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}nav img{vertical-align:middle}.grid img{border-radius:20px}h1,h2{letter-spacing:-.035em}main{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 3%,#ffebbe 0,transparent 310px)}.btn{margin:6px 0}</style><main><nav style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\" style=\"width:120px\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><h1>Wiggleway</h1><p>Pick one way to play. Learn the rule, then put the phone away.</p><section class=\"box\"><h2>1. Colour Composer</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Choose an endpoint and a colour. Walk the ribbon to the other end. Clap once on your chosen colour and stay quiet on the others. Next round give a second colour two claps. Finish a whole trail without mixing up your tune.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>2. Growing Journey</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Begin on a ring. Visit the next spot and return home. Then visit the next two spots and return. Add one spot each trip. Say the colours on the outward journey; on the return, try to say each next colour before looking down. Reach the far ring to finish.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>3. Echo Parade</h2><b>2 or more, taking turns</b><p>The leader walks the whole trail, adding a clap, wave or freeze at ONE chosen spot. The next player repeats the journey and adds one action at a new spot. Keep the same order. When someone forgets, help them and begin a fresh parade.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>4. Story Steps</h2><b>1 or more, taking turns</b><p>Choose what each colour means: a place, a creature, an object or a surprise. Travel the trail and add one spoken sentence at each stop using that colour’s meaning. Reach the final ring to finish the story. Next trip, change the meanings.</p></section><p>Use a clear, level indoor floor. Start by walking; try jumps only when comfortable. Take turns unless a game calls for two players on separate spots.</p><a class=\"btn\" download href=\"/floor-play-images/wiggleway/four-ways.png\">Save the four-way instruction image</a><p><a href=\"/floor-games/wiggleway/\">See the game and its size</a></p></main></html>",
  "/play/jump-jamboree": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Jump Jamboree • Play guide | MimiPip</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff9ee;color:#253d53;font:18px/1.5 system-ui}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,74px);line-height:1.04;margin:16px 0}h2{margin-top:34px}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.brand{letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:750}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:18px}.box{background:white;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:12px 0}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#253d53;color:white;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none}a{color:#164e67}figure{margin:0}figcaption{font-size:15px}details{padding:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}nav img{vertical-align:middle}.grid img{border-radius:20px}h1,h2{letter-spacing:-.035em}main{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 3%,#ffebbe 0,transparent 310px)}.btn{margin:6px 0}</style><main><nav style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\" style=\"width:120px\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><h1>Jump Jamboree</h1><p>Pick one way to play. Learn the rule, then put the phone away.</p><section class=\"box\"><h2>1. Together / Apart</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Start at the bottom single pad. Move one row forward at a time: land with feet together on a single pad and one foot on each pad of a pair. Pause to balance after each landing. Finish at the top. Practise by stepping before trying jumps.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>2. Dot Orchestra</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Walk up the track. At each row, clap the number of dots on ONE pad: one or two. Keep your feet still while clapping. After reaching the top, turn around and play the rhythm backwards. Can you do both directions without a missed beat?</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>3. Copy My Six</h2><b>2 or more, taking turns</b><p>The composer walks the six rows and chooses one action per row: clap, wave or freeze. Everyone watches. The next child follows and copies all six in order. Begin with only two rows; extend the sequence when the group is ready. Swap composer each round.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>4. Silent Landing</h2><b>1 child or a cooperative group</b><p>Make one trip, stepping or making small two-foot jumps to the next row. Pause at each arrival and judge your landing: quiet and steady, or try again. Count how many of the six rows felt controlled. Repeat to match your best; the goal is control, not speed or distance.</p></section><p>Use a clear, level indoor floor. Start by walking; try jumps only when comfortable. Take turns unless a game calls for two players on separate spots.</p><a class=\"btn\" download href=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/four-ways.png\">Save the four-way instruction image</a><p><a href=\"/floor-games/jump-jamboree/\">See the game and its size</a></p></main></html>",
  "/play/fork-and-friends": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Fork &amp; Friends • Play guide | MimiPip</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff9ee;color:#253d53;font:18px/1.5 system-ui}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:24px}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,74px);line-height:1.04;margin:16px 0}h2{margin-top:34px}img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.brand{letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:750}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:18px}.box{background:white;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:12px 0}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#253d53;color:white;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:24px;text-decoration:none}a{color:#164e67}figure{margin:0}figcaption{font-size:15px}details{padding:12px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}nav img{vertical-align:middle}.grid img{border-radius:20px}h1,h2{letter-spacing:-.035em}main{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 3%,#ffebbe 0,transparent 310px)}.btn{margin:6px 0}</style><main><nav style=\"display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\" style=\"width:120px\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><h1>Fork &amp; Friends</h1><p>Pick one way to play. Learn the rule, then put the phone away.</p><section class=\"box\"><h2>1. Find Another Way</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Walk from one blue ring to the other along the printed links. Do not revisit a spot on that trip. Return around the outside of the sticker, then find a different route. Begin with two different routes. There are six shortest routes to discover.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>2. Yellow Detour</h2><b>1 child</b><p>Travel from ring to ring without touching yellow. Try both sides. Next, make a trip that MUST visit yellow. Finally visit both outermost spots in one trip without revisiting a spot. Walk the connections; this is a thinking challenge.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>3. Meet in the Middle?</h2><b>2 children</b><p>Start on opposite blue rings. Take turns moving along ONE link to an empty spot. Work together to exchange starting places. Never share a spot or pass through each other. Use the side branches to make room. After succeeding, try with fewer total moves.</p></section><section class=\"box\"><h2>4. Route Director</h2><b>2 children</b><p>One child stands on a blue ring; the other is the director. Before the walker moves, the director says the colours for an entire route to the opposite ring. The walker follows one link at a time. If a colour offers two choices, the director must also point. Swap roles after each trip.</p></section><p>Use a clear, level indoor floor. Start by walking; try jumps only when comfortable. Take turns unless a game calls for two players on separate spots.</p><a class=\"btn\" download href=\"/floor-play-images/fork-and-friends/four-ways.png\">Save the four-way instruction image</a><p><a href=\"/floor-games/fork-and-friends/\">See the game and its size</a></p></main></html>",
