rid-template-columns:1fr}.detail{gap:15px}.intro{padding-top:24px}}</style><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://mimipip.com/products/hopscotch-peach-pop\"></head><body><main><nav><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><section class=\"detail\"><img class=\"room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/room-v4.webp\" alt=\"Peach Pop floor sticker shown installed in a child’s playroom\"><div><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--t:#ffe0cf\">Hopscotch</span><h1>Peach Pop</h1><p>Follow the numbers from one to ten, one little hop at a time.</p><p><strong>75 × 260 cm</strong> · One connected floor sticker</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/choose-floor/hopscotch-peach-pop/\">Choose quantity and add to cart</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/play/hopscotch-peach-pop/\">Explore four ways to play</a><p>₹3,999 including GST · delivery included · <a href=\"/choose-floor/hopscotch-peach-pop/\">Buy in India</a></p></div></section><figure style=\"margin:28px 0;max-width:620px\"><figcaption style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><strong>See it in play</strong> · Hop from one square to two</figcaption><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:20px\" src=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/play-v4.webp\" alt=\"A child playing the floor game in an oak-floored bedroom\"></figure><div class=\"more\"><details><summary>See the exact sticker and dimensions</summary><a href=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/art.png\"><img src=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/product.png\" alt=\"Flat artwork and dimensions for Peach Pop\"></a><p>The first image is a room render. Measure 75 × 260 cm on your floor and leave space to move around the game.</p></details><details><summary>How it arrives</summary><p>Your game arrives rolled in one piece, in a 77 cm tube. Lay it out before peeling the backing so you can choose its spot.</p><a href=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/packing.png\">View the packing illustration</a></details><details><summary>Keep the play guide</summary><p>Read the rules once, then put the phone away.</p><a href=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/four-ways.png\">Save the instruction image</a> · <a href=\"/floor-play-images/hopscotch-peach-pop/scan-card.png\">Open the QR card</a></details><p><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Explore all floor games</a></p></div></main></body></html>",
