ng.png\">See the packing illustration</a></details><details><summary>Keep the play guide</summary><p>Read the rules once, then put the phone away.</p><a href=\"/floor-play-images/wiggleway/four-ways.png\">Save the instruction image</a> · <a href=\"/floor-play-images/wiggleway/scan-card.png\">Open the QR card</a></details><p><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Explore all floor games</a></p></div></main></body></html>",
  "/floor-games/jump-jamboree": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Jump Jamboree | MimiPip</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fffaf2;color:#263c43;font:17px/1.55 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1190px;margin:auto;padding:0 clamp(18px,4vw,56px) 70px}nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e7dfd2}nav img{width:120px;vertical-align:middle}a{color:inherit}nav a,.card{text-decoration:none}a:hover .title,nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #166c70;outline-offset:4px}h1,h2,.title{font-family:ui-rounded,'Avenir Next',system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,78px);margin:.18em 0}h2,.title{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,40px);margin:.22em 0}.ey{font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px}.intro{padding:42px 0 30px}.intro p{margin:.4em 0;max-width:570px}.tiles,.detail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(18px,3vw,40px)}.card{display:block;margin-bottom:12px}.room{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:22px}.caption{padding:17px 3px 4px}.chip{background:var(--t);border-radius:20px;padding:5px 12px;display:inline-block;font-weight:650;font-size:13px}.caption p{margin:.3em 0}.size{font-size:14px;color:#53656b}.detail{padding:35px 0;align-items:center}.detail h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,72px)}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#21484a;color:white;border-radius:28px;padding:10px 20px;margin:5px 0;text-decoration:none}.more{max-width:820px;margin:20px auto}details{border-top:1px solid #ddd6c9;padding:18px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}details img{max-width:440px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:15px 0}.home{font-size:14px}@media(max-width:670px){.tiles,.detail{grid-template-columns:1fr}.detail{gap:15px}.intro{padding-top:24px}}</style><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://mimipip.com/floor-games/jump-jamboree/\"></head><body><main><nav><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/brand/mimi-pip/email-wordmark.png\" alt=\"MimiPip home\"></a><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Floor games</a></nav><section class=\"detail\"><img class=\"room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/room-v4.webp\" alt=\"Jump Jamboree floor sticker illustrated in a child’s playroom\"><div><span class=\"chip\" style=\"--t:#ffe9a9\">Jump &amp; balance</span><h1>Jump Jamboree</h1><p>Feet together, feet apart. Turn six rows of dots into a clapping tune.</p><p><strong>82 × 214 cm</strong> · One connected floor sticker.</p><p><strong style=\"font-size:28px\">₹3,778</strong> including GST · Free delivery in India</p><p>Free delivery in India. Orders before 2 pm IST dispatch the same day; later orders dispatch the next day.</p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/choose-floor/jump-jamboree/\">Buy Jump Jamboree</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/play/jump-jamboree/\">Explore four ways to play</a></div></section><figure style=\"margin:28px 0;max-width:620px\"><figcaption style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><strong>See it in play</strong> · Land with feet apart</figcaption><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:20px\" src=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/play-v4.webp\" alt=\"A child playing the floor game in a cork-floored playroom\"></figure><section id=\"how-to-play\"><h2>One game, four ways to play</h2><p>Start at the bottom coral pad. The six rows run single, pair, pair, single, pair, single.</p><ol><li><strong>Together / Apart.</strong> Step or jump one row at a time. Both feet fit on a single pad; put one foot on each pad of a pair.</li><li><strong>Dot Orchestra.</strong> Stop at each row and clap the dots on one pad. Keep your feet still while clapping.</li><li><strong>Copy My Six.</strong> Take turns inventing and copying a sequence of claps, waves and freezes.</li><li><strong>Silent Landing.</strong> Make a steady, quiet trip along the rows. Aim for control and balance.</li></ol><p><a href=\"/play/jump-jamboree/\">Read the complete play instructions</a></p></section><div class=\"more\"><details><summary>See the exact sticker and dimensions</summary><a href=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/art.png\"><img src=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/product.png\" alt=\"Flat artwork and dimensions for Jump Jamboree\"></a><p>The first image is a room render. Measure 82 × 214 cm on your floor and leave space to move around the game.</p></details><details><summary>What arrives</summary><p>One connected floor sticker, rolled for delivery. Delivery within India is included. Orders placed before 2 pm IST dispatch the same day; orders placed at or after 2 pm dispatch the next day. Artwork measures 82 × 214 cm. Place it on a clear, level indoor floor with room to step off at either end. Contact hello@mimipip.com to check suitability for your floor and delivery availability.</p><a href=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/packing.png\">View the packing illustration</a></details><details><summary>Keep the play guide and QR</summary><p>Read the rules once, then put the phone away. The QR below opens the same four play instructions.<img src=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/scan-card.png\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"QR card linking to the Jump Jamboree play guide\"></p><a href=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/four-ways.png\">Save the instruction image</a> · <a href=\"/floor-play-images/jump-jamboree/scan-card.png\">Open the QR card</a></details><p><a href=\"/floor-games/\">Explore all floor games</a></p></div></main></body></html>",
